NOT A PRODUCTION SYSTEM.

This repository contains a simulated industrial plant and a worked security
assessment of a fictional facility. No facility described here is real, no
control logic here has been validated against any functional safety standard,
and nothing in it is fit to be connected to plant. The warranty disclaimer
above is not boilerplate in this context — it is the point.

