THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The container images this project composes carry their own licences:

  OpenPLC Runtime    GPL-3.0
  FUXA               MIT          (see docs/adr/0012-fuxa-scada.md)
  TimescaleDB        Apache-2.0 / Timescale License, per component
  PostgreSQL         PostgreSQL License

These are pulled as published images and are not redistributed here. ADR-012
records why FUXA was chosen over a more capable alternative, and the reason
is its licence rather than its features.
